Actually, the most robust way to express "more than all" is using `QUANTIFIER_PREDICATE` with `ALL`.

```json
[
  {
    "target": [ "e1" ],
    "entities": [
      { "id": "e1", "type": "Footballer" },
      { "id": "e2", "type": "Team" },
      { "id": "e3", "type": "Footballer" }
    ],
    "relationships": [
      { "id": "r1", "role": "plays_for", "from": "e1", "to": "e2" },
      { "id": "r2", "role": "plays_for", "from": "e3", "to": "e2" }
    ],
    "constraint": {
      "quantifier_kind": "ALL",
      "list": {
